1
00:00:00,104 --> 00:00:01,934
(Raj:)It's called being nice.

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:06,730
(Sheldon:)Okay, if you think being nice
will get him to shut up, I'll try it.

3
00:00:08,212 --> 00:00:09,802
You know what, guys, never mind.

4
00:00:10,014 --> 00:00:14,214
(Howard:)I just won't talk about the greatest
achievement of my life ever again.

5
00:00:14,418 --> 00:00:16,788
(Sheldon:)Look at that, the problem solved itself.

6
00:00:24,095 --> 00:00:25,965
(Leonard:)Hello, boys.

7
00:00:28,833 --> 00:00:34,003
(Sheldon:)What if we were to go
as dinner table favorites, salt and pepper?

8
00:00:34,438 --> 00:00:36,308
(Amy:)You know salt makes me retain water...

9
00:00:36,507 --> 00:00:40,237
(Amy:)...and my cousin, William, was ground
to death in a pepper factory accident.

10
00:00:42,179 --> 00:00:44,649
(Amy:)Raggedy Ann and Andy?
I loved them growing up.

11
00:00:44,849 --> 00:00:48,449
(Sheldon:)I don't think so. Those dolls represent
three things I don't care for:

12
00:00:48,653 --> 00:00:51,983
Clowns, children, and raggedyness.

13
00:00:53,524 --> 00:00:56,024
(Sheldon:)- I think it's a lost cause.
- No.

